1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The person you clicked with
last week?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,500
They're not going to
follow up with you.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:11,500
Not because they don't like you. Because they're doing what you're doing:
assuming it'll happen on its own.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,500
Weak ties have a half-life. Every silent week cuts the odds.

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:20,500
One low-pressure message. “Good meeting you. I'm going again
next week — you in?”

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:24,500
That's it. That's how
acquaintances become friends.

7
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,500
Start with one social rep. Link in bio.
